					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-170966#post-1539655</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-170966/scp-334-j#post-1539655</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 16 Aug 2012 22:32:32 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Kingreaper</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>60748</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">some&nbsp;phrasing&nbsp;issues</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>&quot;including any groups of interest including the Chaos Insurgency or [DATA EXPUNGED]&quot;</p> <p>Should probably be<br /> &quot;including any groups of interest such as/particularly the Chaos Insurgency or [DATA EXPUNGED]&quot;</p> <p>&quot;it appears to have a low separation threshold between other planes of existence&quot;<br /> Should probably be<br /> &quot;it appears to have a low separation threshold from/weak boundary with other planes of existence&quot;</p> </div> </div> </div> <p>Overall I just don't like it. The dimension of lost socks concept is okay, but throwing the dog-like entities in harms it enough to make it a -1.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
